cylinder OutPinPilot0 radius (m3_pilot/2) height (top_z-base_z-base_t+2.1 mm) base (out_circle*cos(0*360 deg/n_out),out_circle*sin(0*360 deg/n_out),base_z+base_t-2 mm) cut targets OutputBase
cylinder OutPinPilot1 radius (m3_pilot/2) height (top_z-base_z-base_t+2.1 mm) base (out_circle*cos(1*360 deg/n_out),out_circle*sin(1*360 deg/n_out),base_z+base_t-2 mm) cut targets OutputBase
