cylinder TopHole0 radius (m3_clear/2) height (top_t+2 mm) base (out_circle*cos(0*360 deg/n_out),out_circle*sin(0*360 deg/n_out),top_z-1 mm) cut targets OutputTop
cylinder TopCounterbore0 radius (m3_head/2) height (m3_head_h+1 mm) base (out_circle*cos(0*360 deg/n_out),out_circle*sin(0*360 deg/n_out),top_z+top_t-m3_head_h) cut targets OutputTop
