cylinder InputPocket radius (in_r+shaft_clear) height 4.5 mm base (0,0,top_z-1 mm) cut targets OutputTop
cylinder OutputShaft radius out_r height (out_len+0.5 mm) base (0,0,top_z+top_t-0.5 mm) join targets OutputTop
